{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">The proposed development, by reason of bulk, mass, scale, siting, and lack of setback, would appear unduly prominent and unsympathetic to the character of the host dwelling and surrounding </span><span class=\"scayt-misspell-word\" data-scayt-word=\"streetscene\" data-wsc-lang=\"en_GB\" data-wsc-id=\"mgp0hivkc3t2gcziq\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">streetscene</span>. As such, the proposed development is contrary to:<br></div><div><br></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">-\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework</span>&nbsp;(NPPF) (MHCLG, December 2024)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- Policy D4 of the\r\nLondon Plan (March 2021)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of t</span>he London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)</span></p></div>",
    "&lt;div&gt;The proposed two-storey side extension, by reason of its bulk, mass, scale, siting and design, would result in an unacceptable loss of daylight and outlook, cause significant overshadowing, and have an overbearing impact on the neighbouring property at No. 3 Canberra Close, therefore constituting unneighbourly development and contrary to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;-\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;(NPPF) (MHCLG, December 2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policy\r\nD6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of t&lt;/span&gt;he London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
